 de queda livre e o jogo da marreta.", "short_description": "Epic Fun \u00e9 um conjunto de atra\u00e7\u00f5es inspiradas em parques tem\u00e1ticos.\n\nAs montanhas-russas s\u00e3o nossas principais atra\u00e7\u00f5es! S\u00e3o seis no total e cada uma possui tem\u00e1tica \u00fanica e acompanha um exclusivo jogo de tiro sobre trilhos!\n\nN\u00e3o deixe de testar o seu medo de altura em nossa torre de queda livre, e fazer um tranquilo passeio em nossa roda gigante repleta de eventos.\n\nCompita pela melhor posi\u00e7\u00e3o nas diferentes classifica\u00e7\u00f5es de cada um dos tr\u00eas jogos: Tiro, Dardo e Marreta."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "2224673754494019", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982624_1231508220367103_115557499553185792_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=0RD39reOws4Q7kNvwG4Dng2&_nc_oc=AdkLBTFIFdlXNzUeImuNBrynyl6o6rT4jUCC0F26Jm95axrl_4O8WcITQzeL9zje8Ms&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_Afsqeo1cO9VWucKvSfO7K4HcqpapsOxU-lufbaJkQwnudg&oe=6999B516"}, {"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "684007619008344", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39031490_729985627444273_5976286068549353472_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=9v8zb2lflkYQ7kNvwGvF8x-&_nc_oc=AdnRLOdmnw3n2usMLh1hUpYC0pgzZKOx_u98BC-hD9dHg9WTqwwKIB9putHLkVwLKUE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_Afvl8UBe__A5sAJJfyFRkOdYP_gXN3CFeORsm24iSJjUdg&oe=6999AACF"}, {"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "604787070105792", "image_type": "APP_IMG_HERO", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38984456_474861886688494_5451184045545226240_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=nHUOjiSraTcQ7kNvwE05pf9&_nc_oc=AdnrmdPVtulQ2oc4osAoJoQ8dXs0R8wuK6W1P83AWdZeqrtuoGKv2kVOpKcNvO2PgjY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AfvBB67appPJtqiEIIlVNu44Uc